  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nNEW FINS HAVE LANDED 🏄 SHOP NOW \n\nSHOP\nEXPLORE\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nCart\nFREEDOM TO ESCAPE\n\nAs surfers, we have a deep-rooted desire to escape. Whether it's escaping to a beachside town for months of epic riding or escaping the city on a weekend strike mission, there’s no escape quite like riding the perfect wave on your favorite board.\n\nFIND YOUR BOARD\nFILIPE TOLEDO WILDFIRE\nRegular price\n$330.00 USD\nSold out\nMASON HO RIDE\nRegular price\n$335.00 USD\nSale\nERIC GEISELMAN FLASH\nRegular price\n$330.00 USD \nSale price\n$320.00 USD\nKYUSS KING FISH\nRegular price\n$340.00 USD\nNATHAN FLORENCE JOINS THE RIDE TEAM\n\n“I’m extremely stoked to join the family. I'm looking forward to pushing the limits of performance in the big wave arena.”\n\nPUNCHY BEACH BREAKS\n\nFlat and fast, the Kyuss King Fish is a small wave weapon that turns on a dime. This board will heighten the fun factor on those mushy days when you might not even paddle out.\n\nSHOP THE K-FISH\nSWAP FINS ON THE FLY\n\nOur tool-free fin system makes it easy to swap fins based on wave conditions or rider ability. It’s the ultimate hack to make any board your go-anywhere machine.\n\nSHOP FINS \n\nNEW RELEASE\n\nMEET THE NEOGLASS ECO FIN\nLOW ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT\n\nWe’ve made it our mission to design products that use low impact, sustainable materials while still remaining focused on maintaining the highest quality and performance.\n\nMade with a 50% glass and Bio-Resin EcoBlend™, the NeoGlass Eco range delivers the same quality and trusted feel you’ve come to expect while at the same time reducing our carbon footprint.\n\nSHOP NEOGLASS FIN\n\nPREMIUM QUALITY\nBUILT FOR PERFORMANCE\nINDUSTRY INNOVATION\nSUPPORTS ALL RIDING STYLES\nRIDE WITH US\n\nBe the first to know about new collections and exclusive offers.\n\nEmail\nABOUT RIDE\nSTORIES\nRIDE TEAM\nCONTACT\n\nWe find freedom in the waves, and our journey to find those waves is half the fun.\n\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-ride-demo Powered by Shopify"
}